<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Basic SQL Injection - EliteHackLab</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav">
    <div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/labs/sqli"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> SQLi Labs</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/labs/sqli">SQL Injection</a> / Basic</div>
      <h1>💉 Basic SQL Injection</h1>
      <div class="lab-info">
        <span class="lab-tag difficulty-easy">Easy</span>
        <span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 10 pts</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>The search below queries a product database. The query is vulnerable to SQL injection. Your goal is to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Extract hidden products from the database</li>
        <li>Find the flag hidden in the products table</li>
        <li>Determine the database structure</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Vulnerable Application</h2>
      <form method="GET" action="/labs/sqli/basic" class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Search Products:</label>
        <input type="text" name="search" value="<%= search %>" placeholder="Search for products..." autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-search"></i> Search</button>
      </form>

      <% if (query) { %>
        <div class="hint-box">
          <i class="fas fa-database"></i> <strong>Query executed:</strong>
          <div class="code-block"><%= query %></div>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="warning-box">
          <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> <strong>SQL Error:</strong> <%= error %>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <% if (results.length > 0) { %>
        <div class="result-box">
          <h4 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--neon-green);">Results (<%= results.length %> found):</h4>
          <table style="width:100%; font-size: 0.85rem;">
            <tr style="color: var(--neon-blue);"><th>ID</th><th>Name</th><th>Description</th><th>Price</th><th>Category</th></tr>
            <% results.forEach(function(r) { %>
              <tr>
                <td><%= r.id %></td>
                <td><%= r.name %></td>
                <td><%= r.description %></td>
                <td>$<%= r.price %></td>
                <td><%= r.category %></td>
              </tr>
            <% }); %>
          </table>
        </div>
      <% } else if (search && !error) { %>
        <div class="result-box">No results found.</div>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> Hints</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The query filters with <code>hidden = 0</code>. How can you remove that condition?</li>
        <li>Try: <code>' OR 1=1 --</code></li>
        <li>To see hidden items: <code>' OR hidden=1 --</code></li>
        <li>Try extracting data with: <code>' UNION SELECT 1,2,3,4,5,6 --</code></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="flag-submit">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">Find the hidden flag in the database!</p>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('sqli-basic', 'flagInput_sqli', 'flagResult_sqli'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;">
        <input type="text" id="flagInput_sqli" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button>
      </form>
      <div id="flagResult_sqli" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <button onclick="getHint('sqli-basic')" style="margin-top:0.8rem; padding:0.4rem 1rem; font-size:0.8rem; border:none; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; background:rgba(0,212,255,0.2); color:var(--neon-blue);">💡 Get Hint</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
